@startuml DOC80_D01_Componentes
title DOC-80 - Diagrama UML de componentes
left to right direction
' Convención: CODE = símbolo resoluble; EXT = sistema externo; CONCEPT = concepto.
' Fuentes: webservice/WebServiceImportarServicioWebModern.asmx.vb | Infrastructure/Workflow/ImportarServicioWeb/Sii/SiiImportProvider.vb | Infrastructure/Workflow/ImportarServicioWeb/Sii/SiiExternalImportProviderClient.vb
' Referencias CODE: VB.Interface.ResolveCapabilitiesAsync | VB.Endpoint.ResolveCapabilities | VB.Endpoint.TryBuildImportContext | VB.Provider.ResolveCapabilitiesAsync
actor "Usuario Workflow\nEXT:WorkflowUser" as User <<external>>
component "Cliente moderno\nCONCEPT:ModernImportClient" as Browser <<conceptual>>
component "WebServiceImportarServicioWebModern\nCODE:WebServiceImportarServicioWebModern" as Endpoint
interface "IImportProvider\nCODE:IImportProvider" as Contract
component "SiiImportProvider\nCODE:SiiImportProvider" as Provider
component "SiiExternalImportProviderClient\nCODE:SiiExternalImportProviderClient" as Client
database "Contexto Workflow\nCONCEPT:TrustedWorkflowContext" as Context <<conceptual>>
cloud "SII\nEXT:SII" as SII <<external>>
User --> Browser
Browser --> Endpoint : ResolveCapabilities(request)
Endpoint --> Context : valida sesión, tarea y ENLASE
Endpoint --> Contract : ResolveCapabilitiesAsync(request, cancellationToken)
Contract <|.. Provider
Provider --> Client
Client --> SII : contrato autenticado existente
Endpoint --> Browser : ResolveCapabilitiesResponseDto
note bottom of Endpoint
TryBuildImportContext rechaza gate inactivo, sesión inválida,
tarea no coincidente o actividad distinta de ENLASE.
end note
@enduml
